{
    "_comment": [
        "Priority-ordered list of all visualizations that can appear in the right panel of the output page.",
        "max_shown: how many items from the top of this list are selectable in the GUI.",
        "  The selector shows the first max_shown items that were actually generated for this run,",
        "  skipping entries in the list that were not generated (e.g. if entry #3 was not produced,",
        "  entries #1, #2 and #4 fill the first three slots).",
        "Each entry: type (glb_cone | ply | extra_group), label (display name), match (regex string for extra_group — case-insensitive).",
        "All possible visual types from a main_v2 run are listed below, in descending importance order.",
        "Regex patterns are matched against the humanized folder-path label produced by artifact_index._humanize_path."
    ],
    "max_shown": 3,
